---
import { site } from '../../data';
---
<section id="contact" class="contact section">
  <div class="shell contact-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
    <h2>有一个想做好的<br /><em>独立站项目？</em></h2>
    <p>无论是新站搭建、增长瓶颈，还是运营流程自动化，都欢迎聊聊。请在邮件中简单说明项目背景与期待。</p>
    <a class="contact-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}<span>↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .contact { background: var(--sage-soft); }
  .contact-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .45fr 1.2fr; gap: 1rem 3rem; }
  .eyebrow { grid-row: span 3; align-self: start; }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.7rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  h2 em { color: var(--sage-dark); font-weight: 400; }
  p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 580px; margin: 1.5rem 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .contact-link { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 700px; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem); }
  .contact-link span { transition: transform .2s; }
  .contact-link:hover span { transform: translate(.2rem, -.2rem); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .contact-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .eyebrow { grid-row: auto; } }
</style>
